  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'I lived my life trying to be found by fate and now my life will end in
    solemnity.

    A poetic end, fitting to my way of living.

    I am writing
    this letter to whoever finds it!

    My name is dr. Robert Johnson and as of
    this writing, I am stranded on an island somewhere in the Pacific Ocean.

    I
    was travelling onboard "Lachesis" with my crew on an expedition when a fierce
    storm hit our ship... All my life''s work swept away in a moment...

    Last
    thing I remember was hitting my head on a railing. I woke up on the shore of
    this island with no other survivors to be found.


    If you are reading this,
    please send help.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e4859bfcf60644096d5eaa839bbefe, type: 2}
